{"ticker":"OKE","updated":"2026-10-23T23:25:09Z","profile":{"longName":"ONEOK, Inc.","shortName":"ONEOK, Inc.","sector":"Energy","industry":"Oil & Gas Midstream","country":"United States","website":"https://www.oneok.com","fullTimeEmployees":6326,"marketCap":60412116992,"trailingPE":16.550951,"forwardPE":15.666022,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.5346267,"pegRatio":1.8,"targetMeanPrice":101.1,"targetHighPrice":112.0,"targetLowPrice":91.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":20,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.528,"earningsGrowth":0.142,"grossMargins":0.27214,"operatingMargins":0.13254,"profitMargins":0.09287,"totalRevenue":39366000640,"beta":0.798,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":99.85,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":64.02,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":4.56},"summary":"ONEOK, Inc. operates as a midstream service provider of gathering, processing, fractionation, transportation, storage, and marine export services in the United States. It operates in four segments: Natural Gas Gathering and Processing; Natural Gas Liquids; Natural Gas Pipelines; and Refined Products and Crude. The company owns natural gas gathering pipelines and processing plants in the Mid-Continent, Permian Basin, North Texas, Gulf Coast region, and Rocky Mountain regions; and provides midstream services to producers of NGLs. It also owns NGL gathering and distribution pipelines, fractionation, terminal and storage facilities; and transports refined products, including gasoline, diesel fuel, aviation fuel, kerosene, and heating oil. In addition, the company transports and stores natural gas through regulated interstate and intrastate natural gas transmission pipelines, and natural gas storage facilities; it owns and operates a parking garage in downtown Tulsa, Oklahoma; and leases buildings, warehouses, office space, land, and equipment, including pipeline equipment, pipeline capacity, rail cars, and information technology equipment. Further, the company transports, stores, and distributes refined products, purity NGLs, and crude oil, as well as conducts commodity-related activities, including liquids blending and marketing activities. It serves integrated and independent exp","summary_zh":"ONEOK, Inc. 在美國作為收集、加工、分餾、運輸、儲存和海運出口服務的中游服務提供者。它分為四個部門：天然氣收集和加工；液化天然氣；天然氣管道；以及精煉產品和原油。該公司在中大陸、二疊紀盆地、德克薩斯州北部、墨西哥灣沿岸地區和落基山脈地區擁有天然氣集輸管道和加工廠；並為液化天然氣生產商提供中游服務。還擁有NGL集輸管、分餾、接收站和儲存設施；並運送成品油，包括汽油、柴油、航空燃料、煤油和暖氣油。此外，該公司還透過受監管的州際和州內天然氣輸送管道以及天然氣儲存設施運輸和儲存天然氣；它在俄克拉荷馬州塔爾薩市中心擁有並經營一個停車場；並租賃建築物、倉庫、辦公空間、土地和設備，包括管道設備、管道容量、軌道車輛和資訊技術設備。此外，該公司還運輸、儲存和分銷精煉產品、純淨液化天然氣和原油，並進行商品相關活動，包括液體混合和行銷活動。服務於綜合型和獨立型出口","sector_zh":"活力","industry_zh":"石油和天然氣中游","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":74.82,"h":75.65,"l":74.38,"c":74.43,"v":2757000},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":74.1,"h":74.48,"l":73.41,"c":74.42,"v":7253900},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":74.24,"h":75.55,"l":74.13,"c":75.08,"v":2302000},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":75.37,"h":76.02,"l":74.71,"c":75.89,"v":2461000},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":75.83,"h":76.44,"l":75.64,"c":76.38,"v":2652600},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":75.92,"h":76.23,"l":73.63,"c":74.62,"v":4885000},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":74.27,"h":74.53,"l":73.6,"c":73.87,"v":3394600},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":74.05,"h":74.52,"l":73.58,"c":74.38,"v":2505800},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":74.01,"h":74.14,"l":70.63,"c":72.63,"v":4956300},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":73.19,"h":73.53,"l":71.07,"c":71.36,"v":3914100},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":71.9,"h":72.6,"l":71.61,"c":71.84,"v":3491000},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":71.84,"h":73.37,"l":71.73,"c":73.35,"v":3402700},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":72.52,"h":73.49,"l":72.36,"c":73.3,"v":2436600},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":73.78,"h":73.87,"l":73.05,"c":73.05,"v":2452200},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":73.46,"h":73.49,"l":72.53,"c":72.61,"v":2887200},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":73.06,"h":73.31,"l":72.31,"c":72.58,"v":2645200},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":72.41,"h":73.77,"l":72.31,"c":72.86,"v":2723600},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":73.7,"h":74.34,"l":73.3,"c":73.58,"v":3301500},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":73.68,"h":73.73,"l":71.02,"c":71.55,"v":8657100},{"t":"2025-09