YSE:OKE): Is the Midland Basin Deal Unlocking Value?","src":"Kalkine Media","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxQUTJMRXNwQWdLdGo1SENkZFZSTDF5eUU3Y2VUWktWTERwVExTOEZtbGplX3lBUEItVWhleThPdjZyTkgtaHBqQktZa0haSV9JaklLOXY3MEV6VWdDNFN3emxEZy0tc0FIOTdkbUZkMDNEeUYtVHRmNnFLd1pNY3RpMUlsaEYzckJCY3Vkd3Y1X0FuWlo2U0tDQ00xRi1sdw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-21","zh":"ONEOK（NYSE：OKE）：米德蘭盆地交易能否釋放價值？"},{"title":"Apollo Global Management stock gains role in ONEOK’s USD 9 billion equity deal","src":"AD HOC NEWS","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-21","zh":"Apollo Global Management 股票在 ONEOK 90 億美元股權交易中發揮作用"},{"title":"Omaha gas stations face fuel shortages as Gov. Pillen moves to ease deliveries","src":"KMTV 3 News Now Omaha","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxOYXRuRVVQUkF0UjhwU21sS1ZRVzkyaG51U0V1VDhaR2ZqUUdkUjF0TkpRc2haT3pkY09yM2REa0JIRjJJcUJrbk5CTEJYSGVfTGxNaG9sNWdjTzV0NjBlN3EwTVFYNjE2b0hhV2RpdVdTaXZBZ1ZWRTlGY09xdHNlZTFUNWRyUl9ITElwS0pEWmtYQmpqWVkzOFVvekp1NUFja3JEYURnZnQzQ2oyTko1RzJFTERKLW8?oc=5","date":"2026-10-20","zh":"由於州長皮倫採取措施緩解運輸困難，奧馬哈加油站面臨燃料短缺"}],"themes":[{"name":"訂單/合約","count":4},{"name":"財報","count":3},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2},{"name":"能源/電力","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-24","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1039684/000103968426000006/oke-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"We are incorporated under the laws of the state of Oklahoma, and our common stock is listed on the NYSE under the trading symbol \"OKE.\" We deliver energy products and services vital to an advancing world. We are a leading midstream service provider of gathering, processing, fractionation, transportation, storage and marine export services. As one of the largest integrated energy infrastructure companies in North America, we are delivering energy that makes a difference in the lives of people in the U.S. and around the world. Through our approximately 60,000-mile pipeline network, we transport the natural gas, NGLs, Refined Products and crude oil that help meet domestic and international energy demand, contribute to energy security and provide safe, reliable and responsible energy solutions needed today and into the future.","zh":"我們是根據俄克拉荷馬州法律註冊成立的，我們的普通股在紐約證券交易所上市，交易代號為「OKE」。我們提供對不斷進步的世界至關重要的能源產品和服務。我們是領先的採集、加工、分餾、運輸、儲存和海運出口服務的中游服務提供者。作為北美最大的綜合能源基礎設施公司之一，我們提供的能源可以改變美國和世界各地人們的生活。透過我們約 60,000 英里的管道網路，我們運輸天然氣、液化天然氣、成品油和原油，幫助滿足國內和國際能源需求，為能源安全做出貢獻，並提供當今和未來所需的安全、可靠和負責任的能源解決方案。"},{"en":"The midstream value chain is a vital part of the energy industry. After crude oil and natural gas are produced from upstream wells, we use our extensive infrastructure to process and transport these raw materials, readying them for end use. For transportation of crude oil, natural gas, Refined Products and NGLs, pipelines are generally the most reliable, lowest cost, least carbon intensive and safest alternative for intermediate and long-haul movements between markets and end users.","zh":"中游價值鏈是能源產業的重要組成部分。從上游油井生產出原油和天然氣後，我們利用廣泛的基礎設施來加工和運輸這些原料，為最終使用做好準備。對於原油、天然氣、成品油和液化天然氣的運輸，管道通常是市場和最終用戶之間的中途和長途運輸最可靠、成本最低、碳密集度最低且最安全的替代方案。"},{"en":"EnLink Acquisition - On January 31, 2025, we completed the EnLink Acquisition. Pursuant to the EnLink Merger Agreement, each publicly held common unit of EnLink was exchanged for a fixed ratio of 0.1412 shares of ONEOK common stock, including EnLink Units that were exchanged for all previously outstanding Series B Preferred Units immediately prior to closing. We issued 41 million shares of common stock with a fair value of $4.0 billion as of the closing date of the EnLink Acquisition. EnLink is now a wholly owned subsidiary.","zh":"EnLink 收購 - 2025 年 1 月 31 日，我們完成了 EnLink 收購。根據 EnLink 合併協議，EnLink 的每個公開持有的普通股均以固定比例 0.1412 股 ONEOK 普通股進行交換，其中包括在交割前將 EnLink 單元交換為所有先前流通的 B 系列優先股的 EnLink 單元。截至 EnLink 收購交割日，我們發行了 4,100 萬股普通股，公允價值為 40 億美元。 EnLink現為全資子公司。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Transportation services - Our regulated natural gas transportation services contracts are based upon rates stated in the respective tariffs, which have generally been established through shipper specific negotiation, discounts and negotiated settlements. The rates are filed with FERC or the appropriate state jurisdictional agencies. In addition, customers typically are assessed fees, such as a commodity charge, and we may retain a percentage of natural gas in-kind for our compression services. Our transportation earnings are primarily fee-based and utilize the following types of contracts:","zh":"運輸服務 - 我們的受監管天然氣運輸服務合約是基於各自關稅中規定的費率，這些費率通常是透過托運人具體談判​​、折扣和協商解決確定的。該費率已提交給 FERC 或相應的州司法機構。此外，客戶通常需要繳納費用，例如商品費用，我們可能會保留一定比例的天然氣實體物用於我們的壓縮服務。我們的運輸收入主要以收費為基礎，並利用以下類型的合約："}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Natural Gas Liquids","val":16010000000,"zh":"天然氣液體"},{"name":"Refined Products & Crude Oil","val":13039000000,"zh":"成品油和原油"},{"name":"Natural Gas Gathering & Processing","val":7684000000,"zh":"天然氣收集和加工"},{"name":"Wholly Owned Interstate Natural Gas Pipelines","val":1846000000,"zh":"全資州際天然氣管道"}],"total":33629000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Liquids Commodity","val":30408000000,"zh":"液體商品"},{"name":"Commodity Sales","val":28878000000,"zh":"商品銷售"},{"name":"Services","val":4751000000,"zh":"服務"},{"name":"Residue Natural Gas Sales","val":3372000000,"zh":"渣油天然氣銷售"},{"name":"Transportationand Storage Revenue","val":3160000000,"zh":"運輸及倉儲收入"},{"name":"Exchange Services & Natural Gas Gathering & Processing Revenue","val":1473000000,"zh":"交易服務及天然氣收集加工收入"},{"name":"Other","val":166000000,"zh":"其他"}],"total":33629000000}},"peers":["WMB","KMI","EPD","ENB","MPLX"]}}